      "native_text_sha256": "6edbbeb82635fba7ddaeb1b1b199ad82ea3641a042ca275b00d02a8c2c977eb1",
      "source_quote": "In view of the above results, and pursuant to Section 146 of the Local Government Act, I, Thomas\nMoore, Chief Election Officer, have proclaimed Stewart Young elected to the office of Mayor, and\nDenise Blackwell, Matt Sahlstrom, Lanny Seaton, Lillian Szpak, Norma Stewart and Roger Wade elected\nto the office of Councillor for a four-year term.",
      "pdf_page": 34
    },
    "2018_councillor_oaths": {
      "source_file": "archive/langford/Council/2018/11/2018-11-05 Regular Council [legacy]/Minutes/20181105-Signed-Minutes-Inaugural-Meeting.pdf",
